@HostAddress = http://localhost:5088

### 1. Morning Prep Forecast
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/forecast?expectedCovers=200
Accept: application/json

### 2. Ingest Cancellations
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/orders/cancellations
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "bookingName": "ABC Conference",
    "canceledCovers": 30,
    "cancellationRate": 0.10,
    "estimatedWasteCost": 200
  }
]
